---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Shield, Lock, CheckCircle2 } from 'lucide-react';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Ledger & Data Governance - NovaTools"
  description="Comprehensive privacy policy for NovaTools. Learn how your files remain 100% private in local browser memory and how third-party advertising cookies operate."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
    <div class="space-y-2 border-b border-[#2A2D33] pb-5">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded border border-[#3FBE73]/30 bg-[#122D1F] px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-mono font-medium text-[#3FBE73]">
        <Shield class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
        <span>Cryptographic Zero-Knowledge Guarantee</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#ECEDEF]">Privacy Policy & Data Governance</h1>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-[#8B8F98] font-mono">Ledger Specification · {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#8B8F98] leading-relaxed">
      {/* Section 1 */}
      <section class="space-y-2 rounded border border-[#2A2D33] bg-[#131418] p-4 sm:p-5">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#ECEDEF] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">1. Zero-Upload Architecture</h2>
        <p>
          At NovaTools (<a href="https://novatools.app" class="text-[#4F8CFF] hover:underline">novatools.app</a>), our fundamental technical premise is that <strong>we do not transmit, collect, process, or store your documents, photos, audio tracks, or videos on any remote servers.</strong>
        </p>
        <p>
          All operations—including PDF merging, audio volume amplification, neural subtitle generation, image compression, video trimming, and EXIF scrubbing—execute <strong>100% locally within your client browser runtime</strong> using WebAssembly, WebCodecs, and Web Workers.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* Section 2 */}
      <section class="space-y-2 rounded border border-[#2A2D33] bg-[#131418] p-4 sm:p-5">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#ECEDEF] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">2. Zero Data Collection Spec</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-1 text-xs text-[#8B8F98]">
          <li>Zero collection or retention of document bytes, images, or audio buffers.</li>
          <li>Zero logging of file names, metadata tags, passwords, or transcription text.</li>
          <li>Zero requirement for user accounts, credentials, or tracking identifiers to use any tool.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      {/* Section 3: Google AdSense and Cookies */}
      <section class="space-y-2 rounded border border-[#2A2D33] bg-[#131418] p-4 sm:p-5">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#ECEDEF] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">3. Advertising & Cookies (Google AdSense)</h2>
        <p>
          To maintain free, open-access infrastructure without paywalls, we may serve programmatic advertisements provided by third-party vendors, such as <strong>Google AdSense</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="rounded border border-[#2A2D33] bg-[#0B0C0F] p-3 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-[#8B8F98] font-mono">
          <p>• Third-Party Vendors: Google uses cookies to serve ads based on prior user visits.</p>
          <p>• Opting Out: Users may opt out of personalized advertising via <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#4F8CFF] hover:underline">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#4F8CFF] hover:underline">aboutads.info</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* Section 4: Contact */}
      <section class="space-y-2 rounded border border-[#2A2D33] bg-[#131418] p-4 sm:p-5">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#ECEDEF] uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">4. Security & Compliance Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For questions regarding local-first execution compliance or audit inquiries: <code class="text-[#4F8CFF] font-mono">privacy@novatools.app</code> or visit our <a href="/contact" class="text-[#4F8CFF] hover:underline">Contact Desk</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
